                                <support><p>Rectangular funerary altar, with simple entabulature. The stone is exceptionally worn, making identification of characters difficult, particularly on the right side.</p>
                                    <material ana="#material.stone.marble" ref="https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/48.html">Marble</material> <!-- DEFAULT VALUE -->
