                        <handDesc>
                            <handNote><p>The handwriting is mostly legible, however there are areas on the right hand side which have been worn away. From what can be seen the handwriting appears to be broad and well spaced, however the size of the handwriting changes, becoming smaller the further down the inscription you go. Some of the sizing of the letter also appears to be inconsistent.</p>
                                <locus from="line1" to="line7">Lines 1–7</locus>
