            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>While still alive, he made (this monument) for himself, resident. To the shades of the underworld, Lucius Valerius Primus, son of Lucius, sexvir amongst
                   the worshippers of the divine household, to Valentia his mother and Lucius Valerius Optatus, his brother.
                </p>
